    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi wayenesihlobo somyeni wakhe, indoda enamandla aphilileyo, esomndeni ka-Elimeleki; igama lakhe lalinguBhowazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URuthe umMowabi wasesithi kuNawomi: Ake ngiye elizweni, ngikhothoze emva kwalowo engizathola umusa emehlweni akhe. Wathi kuye: “Hamba, ndodakazi yami;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahamba wafika wadobha ensimini ngemva kwabavuni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka, uBhowazi wafika evela eBetlehema, wathi kubavuni: “UJehova makabe nani. Zathi kuye: “UJehova makakubusise;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBhowazi wayesethi encekwini yakhe ephethe abavuni: “Ngekabani le ntokazi na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku eyayimiswe phezu kwabavuni yaphendula yathi: “Le yintombi yakwaMowabi eyabuya noNawomi ezweni lakwaMowabi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yathi: Ake ngicoshe, ngibuthe emva kwabavuni phansi kwezithungu; wafika wahlala kusukela ekuseni kwaze kwaba manje, wahlala kancane endlini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBhowazi wasesithi kuRuthe: Uyezwa yini, ndodakazi yami? Ungayi ukuyokwakha kwelinye izwe, futhi ungasuki lapha, kodwa hlala lapha nezincekukazi zami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amehlo akho mawabe sezweni abalivunayo, ubalandele; Angiziyalanga yini izinsizwa ukuba zingakuthinteli na? uma womile, hamba uye ezitsheni, uphuze okudotshwe yizinsizwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wawa ngobuso bakhe, wakhothamela emhlabathini, wathi kuye: “Ngitholeni umusa emehlweni akho ukuba ungangazi, lokhu ngingowezizwe na?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBhowazi waphendula, wathi kuye: “Sekubonakalisiwe kimi ngokugcwele konke okwenzile kunyokozala selokhu kwafa umyeni wakho, nokuthi washiya kanjani uyihlo nonyoko nezwe lokuzalwa kwakho, futhi wafika kubantu owawungabazi ngaphambili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova makakuvuze ngomsebenzi wakho, umvuzo opheleleyo uphiwe nguJehova uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli, othembele phansi kwamaphiko akhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi: “Mangithole umusa emehlweni akho, nkosi yami; ngokuba ungiduduzile, wakhuluma kahle kuyo incekukazi yakho, nakuba ngingenjengenye yezincekukazi zakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UBhowazi wathi kuye: “Woza lapha ngesikhathi sokudla, udle isinkwa, ugcobhoze ucezu lwakho kuviniga.” Wahlala phansi eduze kwabavuni, wafika kuye amabele akhanyiwe, wadla, wasutha, wahamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esesukuma ukukhothoza, uBhowazi walaya izinsizwa zakhe, wathi: “Myekeni akhothoze naphakathi kwezithungu, ningamkhuzi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi-ke ezinye zezandla zabangamabomu maziwele kuye, zizishiye, ukuze azicoshe futhi angamkhuzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhothoza ensimini kwaze kwahlwa, wabhula ayekukhothozile, kwaba yi-efa lebhali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
