          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uninazala wathi kuye: “Uthathephi namuhla na?” kanti ubusebenza kuphi? ubusisiwe okunakile. Wasemtshela uninazala lowo asebenza kuye, wathi: Ibizo lendoda engisebenze layo lamuhla nguBhowazi;",
          "type": "text",
