              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "URuthe wakwaMowabi wathi: “Naye wathi kimi: ‘Kumelwe ubambelele ezinsizweni zami zize ziqede zonke isivuno sami.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
