              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNawomi wayesethi kuRuthe umalokazana wakhe: “Kuhle, ndodakazi yami, ukuba uphume nezincekukazi zakhe, funa bahlangane nawe kwenye insimu.",
          "type": "text",
